//==
// # Closure decided without evaluation
//
// Track D1 (TKT-348), staged for layer 3. A curve's closure as PrepareModel
// decides it, or why it could not: a B-spline whose ends are not its control
// points cannot be decided without evaluating it, and the decoder must not
// evaluate a B-spline (its evaluation may be unavailable in the host, which
// failed 72 of 88 corpus files in Reduced). Follows foundation-decided.types:
// the value case is Decided, the other carries the shared reason.

// Closed or not, or why the question could not be settled from the curve's
// record. Removes: an exception out of Reduced for one edge of the model.
type DecidedClosure
    = Decided(Value: Boolean)
    | Undecided(Reason: UndecidedReason);
